            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present disclosure relates to vertical field effect transistors (FET). The vertical FET according to the invention includes a substrate (101) and a first electrode (102) configured as either a source or a drain of the transistor. The device includes a second electrode (104) configured as the other of the source and the drain, where the second electrode at least partially overlaps the first electrode in an overlapping region. Moreover, the device comprises an active layer (103) that is sandwiched between the first electrode and the second electrode and a gate arrangement including a gate conductor portion (107) and a gate insulating layer (106), which is arranged between the active layer (103) and a gate conductor portion (107). The active layer (103) comprises a 1D material and/or a 2D material. The active layer (103) further comprises a conformal dielectric. The present disclosure also relates to a method (3000) for the manufacture of such vertical field effect transistors.</p>
            </abstract>
